text = "Use WASD or Arrow Keys to move.
Press E to swap the two characters
Press R to restart the level and P to pause the game.

Character 1, Ice Cream: Heavy, moves slow and falls fast, cannot jump. 
Press Q to break fragile objects.

Character 2, Cherry: Light, moves fast and falls slow, can jump and use
 jump pads.

Reach the spoon at the end as fast as you can!!"

